{"name":"辛焱","name_en":"Xinyan","sources":["hoyolab"],"items":[{"title":"初次见面","title_en":"","text":"我是辛焱，璃月港唯一的摇滚乐手，最近在想要不要去其他地方巡回演出，目的地的话...啊，听说你是走遍了很多地方的旅行者，对吧？让我加入你们吧！去哪里都行。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/f842aaf235894e284276964ad7c0d5e7_3613478363322544039.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/fc185023e575e6d5f4361771e1a5121e_1741182838385986797.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/2d8a6eda20a1fa2ed105dd56ff6ae1bc_4335871440194392399.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/e24189b4043b4de407873e16bacf96b2_802029848804792369.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"闲聊·气势","title_en":"","text":"摇滚不可缺少的，就是激情——喂，别发呆了，快动起来！","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/0fa8feec1aad258c6931f30aa7aff7ac_7093825033234412882.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/f420a047ff7b5a3c0ffca1ec2c3911c1_193852598028529351.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/4e9423caa8e75cd96b35e90e01662bb5_3420359827472591491.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/9802d9b377102a7372568f456873b97d_3161901500180710230.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"闲聊·新曲","title_en":"","text":"要不我来弹首曲子给你听，我新写的哦？","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/7bb54b42e8de9ec006255b784114442d_5886272236817657015.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/702a1a5f1f30d32d11df4a7dce117c36_5575955882498321503.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/c714011a9a1df8991ed64c9a04cb798f_1491044694645782103.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/b2f3c575cb906482d0ef58a95539b955_8001637280846565437.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"闲聊·注目","title_en":"","text":"快看那边！好像有很摇滚的东西！","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/73ae40dc872258457eaa743462181bf6_2625747204226026800.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/31bc359dc5111ccfc14633375b10a5c3_7035040456222987188.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/895e49d6db2a553c09c80b655382b899_285642537634049543.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/ab631b61c5cd01644621c7c0c88268a3_292135888694045887.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"下雨的时候","title_en":"","text":"这么大的雨...可不能让琴被淋到了啊。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/89ad7e99fbe4d92685c67b93cf8650a9_772164060829111313.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/8235d9e606270c801dae90e865aa270a_6910651349959292130.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/09cf537aad0eca1df66e965bd6209b24_3918189011071803436.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/90f48534d04d9045eb87ecb9657472d3_565502418556081305.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"打雷的时候","title_en":"","text":"看样子这雨一时半会儿不会停...嗯，但演出不会推迟！","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/85fe6e21892037b3a6f5a36d7c8e48d0_2211794472449923266.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/fe3dfbf6e505dccaf284053302f69624_9185480618448412152.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/4fc9943bf46e429ea76e02abcbcaf933_1692705181413316612.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/c4dbbdd1687180573aef2d4e5b88173b_3834516647892011424.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"下雪的时候","title_en":"","text":"唔...这种天气要怎么吸引观众呢？对了！来一场「暴风雪极限耐力摇滚挑战」怎么样！","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/56d69804ac42a07bb4015b6e1871169a_8001846305443867122.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/97fd106f6aa0b9e3664a3853dc76df02_6686369442113412056.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/2ef29aac14967c7521b26100bdbef019_6134628448598152559.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/575bc6a7744b83cc7972f18832dba062_7801756684087410979.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"刮大风了","title_en":"","text":"呜哇，快找个地方躲躲，不然发型要塌了！","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/d2ae3df870a4b08cac46a91481a9769c_2146572851328617353.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/6e7cb03fae1d5e9aa68babb3691d9fe1_4554613165116562170.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/d690ffab03cab47b57ffd09a10c0b3b6_4211311367465078438.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/2d47947914cf5711b69c63ff39f772f1_1968686051993516855.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"早上好","title_en":"","text":"早啊，我刚刚在开嗓，今天嗓子的状态也好得很呢。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/b1205269f34b38b456b157c7579e850d_8978209969978265219.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/0a0345b623bdaf08a9eae4c8c8456358_3289619432748095488.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/f910c8da3bced194dcc6a51cb6bbcea0_5680987919598317480.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/e5ebcb597f1ad8a7f306a940db47a3b3_9090502564906113165.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"中午好","title_en":"","text":"啊，收工了收工了，哈...没什么事的话，我去打个盹儿。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/560451b6d47e0fcf3af0be0cf3fec5b0_5571568026911914556.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/07c2b5de79192eac87d116cb36230b08_4567256622997644336.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/10a957d61d003c44c5a3e93cee90de5a_153966355842788480.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/a6057ee38d4e2ef09a6f4a32bafe2163_729372279966676593.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"晚上好","title_en":"","text":"马上就要演出了，你也一起来嗨吗？","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/4d2c4ec8514bbc9dce0fd387d6feccdd_2557351038523712594.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/41d4995a87e1d4a3dbe2baac249d495e_1921321704598658382.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/5c51da80be89b7e23c5350cf3a4e888e_1251905127376697882.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/955014806862ef6a4f304be410894730_8650633043966503656.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"晚安","title_en":"","text":"哦，好的，你先去睡吧。我吗？我还要保养我的琴，还想改改曲子，嘿嘿，刚从舞台下来，睡也睡不着的。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/3d3972a22fe1f20e0b886e7f4cdd51d8_5724144730929465684.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/a8039f9135c9ba04622ff566ace5026b_5939894835120914939.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/c539d672c4cf45e703f4b23271311280_3245876774230093304.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/fdd2ea5160f862b5566b071a64c957a6_6720122551567024039.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于辛焱自己·凶恶","title_en":"","text":"你居然不怕我？唉，有人说，我眼神跟刀子一样，衣服不好好穿，讲话也不守规矩。他们一看到我就躲得远远的，哎，真是...只是风格不一样而已，我又不是什么怪物...","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/d5bf4ae4315acb5612373c6ee59004f5_7433630761150956433.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/da8ab5d1ceec455a657f5ae6e8b943df_7359110430859514509.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/b7e3a8d999d6a403fd7c9a6d16fcf079_3821420539929441225.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/39f4d3dabffea067791b791a3fa050ee_5532608215308973934.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于辛焱自己·摇滚","title_en":"","text":"摇滚是从枫丹传过来的，算是新东西吧。不过啊，在璃月挺不受欢迎的，一般人都觉得吵吵嚷嚷，不喜欢听。所以我啊，很感激每一个能来听我唱歌的人，哈哈。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/37e35e67a46842badf2d8256339cfb2a_1014314247574570725.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/c551fdfb63bc7f7ae9cc3c87c51cad29_6908514615476882555.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/6e076c0cc987593ed106edffe61fe3c9_1479540291728002684.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/07cc0a19c7abd8cc4730524f9aa0603b_5131218060376348942.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于我们·观演","title_en":"","text":"来看我演出？哈，到前面来吧！前面的感觉更好。咳咳，那么，璃月港独一份的摇滚现场，现在开始！","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/8a2a02487422d53bdc5791be38b87f27_6962788119391689908.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/240e84f8e004d946c3057826196b91a3_6504367744924016307.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/9ac76317c57c7bb6dba271aba4846ac2_767837357935738648.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/3b2a9f6d549690019616958b04809412_603288442114279773.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于我们·投缘","title_en":"","text":"我还在想为什么和你这么聊得来，原来你不是这个世界的人，那也就用不着关心这个世界的条条框框了——人生就该是这样！繁文缛节什么的统统闪一边去，无拘无束，自由自在。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/6542216824ed5a2e103de3a488d5f858_5578444355798936632.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/88248450a44ce94660a523d1ba05fb5d_3942832144119275961.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/20844b780cd4c8e93c7116382d4abfc9_4558954719158217258.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/585e1bce2e79e480f2ed2ab0065f8d6d_1093601125375090341.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于我们·邀请","title_en":"","text":"我想让我摇滚的音乐元素更丰富一点。其实，你的节奏感很好嘛，要不要试试帮我打鼓？没打过？唉呀，不要怯场，关键是气势。来试试看嘛，你绝对很有天赋的。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/9606d89b0e4cf32672245d7222342ea8_5203860146424529637.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/0302ec957ac6abc227990b0f854e8682_1198816026382275681.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/be1470d5ba88d4072c54f59a2f5ca075_597057724973387544.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/d3b2b465105fe5cffb771bf0cfdf4b71_223939724205130900.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于「神之眼」","title_en":"","text":"会把「神之眼」的火用来给摇滚伴奏的，估计全提瓦特也就我一个。有人批评我，应该好好敬重这种力量...不过，既然神都把「神之眼」给了我，就说明他对我的用法，也是认可的吧。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/550e847bca63fc45ef39502410a1040b_8187785771891946122.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/5c2de6c29482ce9fe35ec1a8d16e6416_4725597204805005804.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/3aef4a7aeb8caba851b53b708360e599_2485525129234463528.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/7b4ab52ef411a25ba101fc9ade0fa1f5_3341439038129733644.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"有什么想要分享·命名","title_en":"","text":"这把琴，是我亲手做的哦。本来是按照枫丹的摇滚乐器来做的，但做着做着就不再是一个东西了。我一直想给它取一个好听又好记的名字，比如「焱琴」「碎玉」「定山」什么的，但还是差点味道...你有什么好主意吗？","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/1209411a98e4d5fec8a6b4da1faaf274_7773490593889434271.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/c9352cfa527bf1d8706b216dd07bb21f_8510051854162253830.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/ed3db47dfce08eec2679c2308bb3c608_7486048929151742182.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/a403dab52377e11a39582a78bb4826b9_9147949375005031082.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"有什么想要分享·宴乐","title_en":"","text":"欸，你知道「宴乐」吗？就是有钱人在宴会上听的曲子。一会儿唱这个多有本事，一会儿又唱那个多了不起...把音乐用成这个样子，哎呀，一点儿都不摇滚。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/404ac6449bfaa229071adba1aff23209_7076656640889730584.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/fe9b9314130fe4f4c3b909bc0f4c1704_6019664665355061615.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/2a39ba398515bfe3659b1258c8295834_7092965165475023593.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/cbf45c7de77048bd44136190493413ee_8964885974668966092.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"感兴趣的见闻","title_en":"","text":"我最喜欢的一套演出服，是我亲手用「霓裳花」织的。你肯定也见过那种花吧，红得够激情。而且，和我的摇滚也很搭呢。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/922946713385696b66ccee01d7f8e151_1092659909242569576.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/a146634d2ddc5f2de728ff3dff96763c_3692051235164574352.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/77ca560c4c87f348cc475f822286bfb0_4017063644531244952.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/ab2f87c5c7f911bc46a4e2871ac6e7ff_7190203029788458467.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于香菱","title_en":"","text":"我经常去「万民堂」吃夜宵，香菱如果手头不忙，还经常跟我聊天，一直聊到很晚很晚。啊？你问我都点的啥？嗯...其实是香菱做啥我吃啥，哈哈。每次都不一样，味道也千变万化，她可以说是料理界的「摇滚明星」了！","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/1859a3e7e4d23908f6eafd252086f717_231336695484831092.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/0378bed96db48cb8c8c0930782037f80_936817524016182928.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/555df2b8ad7c2114bbf1045934161c67_2476456189442005173.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/dddc3d43a64a46b77bdbef68d105f8fe_2558878384835919859.mp3"}},"line":0},{"title":"关于钟离","title_en":"","text":"以前没什么人听我的摇滚，有一天他突然来邀请我，说可以去他那里试试，合适的话可以去当驻唱歌手，我心里激动啊，终于有人理解我的音乐了！就直接答应了下来。结果去了场地才知道，他居然是那个「往生堂」的客卿...这明显不合适啊，真是个怪人。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/8c3620c1c64afd5e6b6ce9c7bd05b05a_1099895423760920923.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/a210338754a4a5bb899d082cceb7473b_8654428987346080071.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/0d2d18c53f0513020876b32370c0b2e0_8378881399249139222.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/63e2c86d60191d6ff8a168be66f90352_7845784372481120666.mp3"}},"line":1},{"title":"关于凝光","title_en":"","text":"你知道千岩军吧？他们以前总是妨碍我，说什么这里也不准搭舞台，那里也不准，麻烦死了。咳咳，不过在我找总务司申诉之后，听说那个「天权星」专门修订了璃月的什么...呃...反正是某个规则，划定了演出专属场地，还要申请什么许可。哎...其实还是很麻烦，不过，好歹不用像之前一样，被赶得到处乱跑了嘛。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/43606657350f31ea779fbff37a5ce425_1836083329973186002.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/4e1d401e44d529ee258f8981bdb6fd66_4706783738277972504.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/32a07a36bb7a1d581003a795b5c3b0fa_1516159245173448282.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/48c969b2a9338fc35c601a622df75997_4078515999543593902.mp3"}},"line":2},{"title":"关于白术","title_en":"","text":"白术先生开的药方保养嗓子效果一流，为了答谢他，我在他面前来了一段即兴摇滚，结果...他养的那条蛇就晕了过去。从那以后，那条蛇看到我就一个劲儿地往白术先生的衣领里面钻，哈哈哈。我从那以后才知道，蛇原来对震动很敏感。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/cdd0bf83fe92e269b2883c0bb19f33c0_2066886684576978143.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/e9a1590544ed5233c9af600d259fff52_1748932480267842045.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/ef9094422d251365dcc66b9896886054_4316642177198441883.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/5e866aa56a1a1f341fb369e9b2919745_4404150327696085943.mp3"}},"line":3},{"title":"关于北斗","title_en":"","text":"她啊，说话直爽，气量也大，聊起来特别投缘。「死兆星」号乘风破浪的故事，实在是太帅了，给了我很多摇滚的灵感。嘿嘿，我还专门写了一首歌给他们。现在，只要我唱第一句，好多船员都能跟我唱下去，都快变成船歌啦。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/eaaf9114221f5b9c1883ec1599455365_995056759876400173.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/de5d585a8de0334a5dcb6678669d7601_8752104771420140381.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/ec7713e4a3214d7fabd2fcd039e00b07_4393788954854580460.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/e7113e703e95fabfa10a05364e114e22_3825021336469297713.mp3"}},"line":4},{"title":"关于重云","title_en":"","text":"他超有意思！看上去文静内向，但有一次演出，他好像是被朋友叫过来，要跟我说什么话。舞台上声音太大，我还没听清呢，他已经一个箭步跳上台来和我一起唱了，还唱得特别摇滚。这就叫「人不可貌相」吧。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/41b5d5237ce83478bbd72f34d72b9fe8_3581817687108524547.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/938dff2cdf23a67716616344c7871459_1506150335522897683.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/25c19a44963fb9c2c2feaee048b8b3be_3212206473171574267.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/e9fdaa62e0cc6614889bd79ae06e0fff_7638886911575324478.mp3"}},"line":5},{"title":"关于胡桃","title_en":"","text":"她明明是往生堂的堂主，却每天一副开开心心的样子，完全不知道在想什么。街上碰到的话，还会大大方方地和我打招呼，说什么「喜欢玩火的人，是生意兴隆的保障呢。」...呃，有、有点诡异。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/b00f3506fa38e6a8e31aa600f7245227_6545566566630117488.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/b798f4a99442ef65f90f1f755b926b6a_4234257959746681750.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/22797823819d7c32dfd87877b51b1b35_2902630461146480578.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/2798a6312e0ebebd4b8c678038226055_5833677338477263540.mp3"}},"line":6},{"title":"关于云堇","title_en":"","text":"告诉你个小秘密，别到处乱讲哦。那个人可喜欢摇滚了，不管多忙，一周都来听我三场，只多不少。按理说，「和裕茶馆」的戏班头牌，该喜欢什么琴棋书画，花鸟虫鱼才对吧？肯定是平时被憋坏了，哈哈哈。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/7678d084a0abe95405c3a902c293946a_2573314434279754796.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/01e0f6454ea2a146baeabc1a980e00ba_437808750536599712.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/0c486de67e3ccc382fee37ea50d1ced7_6160723993498514364.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/3c0c23ad4a325d830acd9ce71e2ee7a2_3335285967426085410.mp3"}},"line":7},{"title":"关于嘉明","title_en":"","text":"他第一次说我是「摇滚发烧友」的时候，我还仔细摸了摸额头，回答他说「没有啊」，结果他来了句「你绝对是」，我们争论了小半天，最后才发现是误会，他跟我说「发烧友」就是「爱好者」的意思。哈哈哈，他可真好玩，我要把这个词写进歌里！","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/7282145518bf5495ba84c73b963c8452_6692821063766655801.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/6cc947ff5e2c1c72b2902f3eff373e24_2110850999202513881.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/badfc1ff222ef310e3196c37e49db0ec_4032873168325982986.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/8dca0fdc00f221ad1317623f57c16c7a_1829328700602868339.mp3"}},"line":8},{"title":"想要了解辛焱·其一","title_en":"","text":"想要了解我？哈，一般人看到我就躲得远远的了，你还真是奇怪。那好吧，那就...从了解我的摇滚开始？","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/e8a3d38804d431cba98061d14259db82_6255987009323819406.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/f72f4f25ba4e054b5a63ac626ce7c67c_4359760693995974675.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/58f0f4703b0440819567b1bd4b65c65d_77857566137909638.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/79e760c3827f6db2e98e2445ba627abc_6713890733199896223.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"想要了解辛焱·其二","title_en":"","text":"小时候，大人都让我要像个女孩子，让我学这个，学那个，但我天赋不行，总是挨骂。摇滚就不一样，没人教我，我也能做得很好，但却被大人说「没个女孩儿样」，唉，这就叫成见。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/0f55a8f54d2c05c4f5f9a8aa06c4cf57_5304068976685392675.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/67e9397d97eac58ccc6c861886ee0ad6_7758943861687102241.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/2f952c2804ce32ce183247248931af22_3329108573455107526.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/414b6fc320ea4927500aa74119662e57_7045105107495222982.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"想要了解辛焱·其三","title_en":"","text":"你有注意到我今天有什么区别吗？其实为了见你，我出门之前做了面部的按摩，放松了眼睛和嘴，还对着镜子练习了半小时的微笑。怎么样？是不是看上去没那么凶了？比原来更凶了？唉...","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/5232226bda8fae9bf476d13086e0ad32_7742863370049814752.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/94cdc1f60d4ed5e666a897dd39155fae_8381284138626408035.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/6c03e2cfb7a3d7878450816c5dd66587_2883890044371549642.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/6f16b068d7f09b3d67d5f6c8f1f6cb73_8044139775272485894.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"想要了解辛焱·其四","title_en":"","text":"陪我练琴辛苦了！欸？差不多到中午了，来吃午饭吧，你的份我也准备了！喏，里面有西红柿，香肠，煎蛋...什么？我不像是做这种事的人？别、别小看我啊！做个吃的，摆个可爱的造型，也、也没什么不行的吧。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/79967c070c2863687489f765dcd8c52c_6581682411064423444.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/f17a2387571174c7ee61e0aa242a7eb2_1526806161792413088.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic